Now add grid pose storage in resetRaceState for player and AI, and maybe reset player grid. In player section:

```
const pose = gridPose(playerGridSlot);
p.pos...
...
p.gridPose = { x: pose.x, z: pose.z, yaw: pose.yaw, dist: pose.dist, lateral: pose.lateral, index: startIndex };
```
But startIndex computed later. We can set p.gridPose after startIndex. Let's adjust.

Currently:
```
const playerGridSlot = r.ai.length;
const pose = gridPose(playerGridSlot);
p.pos...
...
const startIndex = r.locator.nearest(pose.x, pose.z).index;
p.lastIndex = startIndex;
...
```
Set `p.gridPose = { ... pose, index: startIndex }`. Also maybe `p.gridSlot = playerGridSlot`.

